  "details": "When eye height is set over 5m via OSC, the desktop mouse cursor to interact with camera settings gets progressively larger on the screen, the taller your avatar is. Eventually getting bigger than the camera itself at ~200m eye height. At 300m it reaches from one side of the entire window to the other, making interacting with the camera tricky, and impossible at extreme heights.",
